WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
A hard word is usually two or three easy rules stacked up.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.150
Hopeful:

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
hope, plus ful, and the e stays because ful starts with a consonant.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:16.930
Take the word apart, use the rules one at a time, and put it back together.
